| ROO311: the !Run for SciCalc in the ROM, written for this project.
| SciCalc was a disc application that needed BASIC64, which lives on the hard disc. A machine with no
| disc has only the BASIC in the ROM, so this uses BASIC64 where it is loaded and BASIC otherwise.
| BASIC works to 9 figures where BASIC64 works to 17.
Set SciCalc$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Alias$SciCalcRun BASIC64 -quit %%*0
RMEnsure BASIC64 1.05 Set Alias$SciCalcRun BASIC -quit %%*0
WimpSlot -min 140K -max 140K
IconSprites <SciCalc$Dir>.!Sprites
SciCalcRun <SciCalc$Dir>.!RunImage
